# Text files are stored in the repository with LF line endings, whatever
# each machine's core.autocrlf setting is. Working-tree line endings are
# left to the local Git configuration.
* text=auto

# Never treat media as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
